<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντάξιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			17.114
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worth just as
				much as,</i> c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς ἀ.</span>
			<i>worth</i> life <i>itself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.401
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλῶν ἀ. ἄλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.514
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκαστος δέκα ἀνδρῶν ἀ.</span>
			<i>worth as much as</i> ten, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.103
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				730d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.10.3
			</span></i> etc.; <i>worthy of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνας</span> Theoc.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>worth as much, worth no
				less,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.136
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
